  description: "Real API security testing OWASP SDET interview questions from senior panels in 2026. Covers the OWASP API Security Top 10, broken object level authorisation (BOLA), broken authentication and JWT security, excessive data exposure and mass assignment vulnerabilities, rate limiting and abuse case testing, injection attacks via API endpoints, improper assets management, and API security testing tools. Built from Mitchell Agoma's 20-year experience across HMRC, MoD, Nationwide, Accenture, Asda, Co-op, and BT.",
