  description: "Real test maintenance strategy SDET interview questions from senior panels in 2026. Covers technical debt in test automation, test suite refactoring patterns, locator maintenance strategies (page object evolution, visual locators, self-healing), flaky test triage and quarantine, automation ROI measurement and defence, test data lifecycle management, and the maintenance anti-patterns that silently kill test suites. Built from Mitchell Agoma's 20-year experience across HMRC, MoD, Nationwide, Accenture, Asda, Co-op, and BT.",
