  "description": "Master CI/CD for SDET interviews in 2026: pipeline architecture for test automation, Jenkins vs GitHub Actions vs GitLab CI, Dockerised test environments, parallel execution strategies, flaky test quarantine, shift-left quality gates, test reporting in CI/CD, blue-green and canary deployments, and the SDET's role in DevOps. Mitchell Agoma's 20-year perspective from HMRC, MoD, Nationwide, Accenture, Asda, Co-op, and BT.",
