  "title": "Browser DevTools for Test Debugging: SDET Interview Questions 2026",
  "description": "Master browser DevTools for test debugging in SDET interviews: Chrome DevTools Protocol (CDP), network interception, HAR file analysis, Performance panel for test optimisation, console API, breakpoints in Playwright/Cypress, memory leak detection, accessibility tree inspection, and Lighthouse CI integration. Mitchell Agoma's 20-year perspective from HMRC, MoD, Nationwide, Accenture, Asda, Co-op, and BT.",
  "date": "2026-06-25",
